# A secure smart building network using Metamorphic Obfuscation (Feature 2).
# The physical routing changes on every transaction, defeating side-channel attacks.

make a neuron named secure_room_a with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a metamorphic router named secure_hallway
make a neuron named secure_room_b with threshold 1 and leak 0

put motion_detected into the input of secure_room_a

# Use 'morph' to enable dynamic spatial obfuscation with a specific key
morph the spike from secure_room_a through secure_hallway to secure_room_b with key 8'hA5

start the system
